sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: The IdToken configured as Expired at the Test System,<br>must be set as Expired at the CSMS

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured expired_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured expired_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse (idTokenInfo.status = Expired or Invalid)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: AuthorizeResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status must be Expired or Invalid
